<title>UK: BOE allots 700 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 700 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 700 million stg of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of one billion.</p>
<p>It allotted three million stg in bills maturing on or before August 20 and 697 million in 6.75 percent repos to August 20.</p>
</text>
